new tool or resource can sometimes be a little bit challenging, especially when there's a wealth of information at your disposal. That's why we've put together this introductory document to assist you in becoming familiar with our guide. This document aims to provide you with an overview and strategies to navigate through the extensive information available, ensuring you have a smooth and productive experience with TikTok API for Business.\n                - heading \"Documentation organization\" [level=2] [ref=f1e90]\n                - paragraph [ref=f1e91]: \"The documentation is structured to help you navigate and find the information you need. Here's an overview of the main sections:\"\n                - list [ref=f1e92]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e93]:\n                    - link \"Overview\" [ref=f1e94] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735712062490625\n                    - text: \": Gain a high-level understanding of TikTok API for Business and its capabilities. This section introduces the platform and its benefits.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e95]:\n                    - link \"What's New\" [ref=f1e96] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1740029165513730\n                    - text: \": Stay updated on a weekly basis with the latest features, enhancements, and changes to TikTok API for Business. This section highlights recent updates and helps you stay informed about the evolving TikTok API for Business.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e97]:\n                    - link \"Get Started\" [ref=f1e98] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713609895937\n                    - text: \": Dive into the details of integrating with TikTok API for Business. This section includes concept clarifications and step-by-step instructions on setting up your developer account and developer app, obtaining API access, and making your first API calls.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e99]:\n                    - link \"FAQs\" [ref=f1e100] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1740029175352322\n                    - text: \": Find answers to frequently asked questions about TikTok API for Business. This section addresses common queries and provides helpful explanations to support your development process.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e101]:\n                    - link \"Use Cases\" [ref=f1e102] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713713137730\n                    - text: \": Explore various implementation guides that demonstrate how to leverage the capabilities of TikTok API for Business in different contexts. This section provides practical resources to inspire and guide you in effectively implementing TikTok API for Business for your specific use cases, such as campaign creation, audience integration, and reporting.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e103]:\n                    - link \"Marketing API\" [ref=f1e104] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1781891416235009\n                    - text: \": Focus specifically on the Marketing API product. This section covers the features and functionalities of the Marketing API, empowering businesses to fully optimize their advertising efforts, including campaign management, Business Center management, creative management, and audience management. With powerful tools and data insights, businesses can achieve better performance, increase return on investment, and reach their target audience more effectively.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e105]:\n                    - link \"Organic API\" [ref=f1e106] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1825101624331329\n                    - text: \": Focus specifically on the Organic API product. This section covers the features and functionalities of the Organic API, enabling brands to manage their organic presence on TikTok and scale their TikTok efforts. The Organic API includes tools for Accounts, Mentions, TikTok One (TTO), Discovery, and Spark Ads Recommendation. By leveraging these tools, brands can refine their organic strategies, collaborate with creators, and amplify content through paid media. The Organic API bridges the gap between organic success and paid growth, maximizing impact and ROI on TikTok.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e107]:\n                    - link \"Business Messaging API\" [ref=f1e108] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1832183871604753\n                    - text: \": Focus specifically on the Business Messaging API product. This section covers the features and functionalities of the Business Messaging API, allowing businesses to integrate direct messaging capabilities to connect directly with TikTok users. The API enables real-time messaging, automated replies, and efficient message thread management. By optimizing messaging strategies, businesses can strengthen relationships with users, enhance customer engagement, and support paid media campaigns. The Business Messaging API empowers developers to create comprehensive solutions that drive brand growth on TikTok and bridge the gap between organic interactions and paid advertising initiatives.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e109]:\n                    - link \"API Reference\" [ref=f1e110] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713875563521\n                    - text: \": Access comprehensive technical documentation for TikTok API for Business. This section provides detailed information on endpoints, request/response structures, and parameters. Developers of all levels can refer to this section for in-depth technical information.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e111]:\n                    - link \"SDK\" [ref=f1e112] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1764231376750658\n                    - text: \": Find SDK-specific documentation and resources. This section provides guidance on using the SDK (software development kit) to simplify integration and streamline the development process.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e113]:\n                    - link \"Appendix\" [ref=f1e114] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1737172315193346\n                    - text: \": Access supplementary materials, such as return codes and enumeration value lists. This section complements the main documentation and offers further support for developers seeking additional information.\"\n                    - strong [ref=f1e115]: Additional resources\n                - paragraph [ref=f1e116]: \"In addition to the main documentation sections, the following resources are also available:\"\n                - list [ref=f1e117]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e118]:\n                    - link \"Developer Blog\" [ref=f1e119] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/blog\n                    - text: \": Explore announcements and how-to guides related to TikTok API for Business and best practices. This resource offers valuable insights and additional resources for developers.\"\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e120]:\n                    - link \"Success Stories\" [ref=f1e121] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://www.tiktok.com/business/en-US/inspiration\n                    - text: \": Discover real-world success stories of businesses or developers who have achieved remarkable results using TikTok API for Business. This 