       - text: \", or\"\n                          - link \"Business Messaging API\" [ref=f1e186] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1832183871604753\n                          - text: ).\n                    - row [ref=f1e187]:\n                      - cell \"I've gone through the available documents but still need further clarification on certain features.\" [ref=f1e188]\n                      - cell [ref=f1e190]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e191]:\n                          - text: See\n                          - link \"TikTok Business Help Center\" [ref=f1e192] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: https://ads.tiktok.com/help/\n                          - text: .\n                    - row [ref=f1e193]:\n                      - cell \"I have specific queries during the integration and want to find readily available answers.\" [ref=f1e194]\n                      - cell [ref=f1e196]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e197]:\n                          - text: See\n                          - link \"FAQs\" [ref=f1e198] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1740029175352322\n                          - text: .\n                    - row [ref=f1e199]:\n                      - cell \"I want to learn about how to integrate with a specific feature, such as Carousel Ads.\" [ref=f1e200]\n                      - cell [ref=f1e202]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e203]:\n                          - text: See\n                          - link \"Use Cases\" [ref=f1e204] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713713137730\n                          - text: .\n                    - row [ref=f1e205]:\n                      - cell \"I'm facing technical issues I can't resolve on my own and need technical assistance.\" [ref=f1e206]\n                      - cell [ref=f1e208]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e209]:\n                          - text: See\n                          - link \"Need support\" [ref=f1e210] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1795190020378625\n                          - text: .\n                    - row [ref=f1e211]:\n                      - cell \"I'm familiar with TikTok Ads Manager and want to know how to create similar ads using the API.\" [ref=f1e212]\n                      - cell [ref=f1e214]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e215]:\n                          - text: See\n                          - link \"Mapping between campaign features in TikTok Ads Manager and API configurations\" [ref=f1e2\n\n[MCP output truncated: showing first 20.0KB of 22.9KB. Full output written to: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.grok\\sessions\\E%3A%5Cproject%5C%E6%B8%85%E6%B3%89%E8%B7%A8%E5%A2%83%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%EF%BC%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%89\\019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147\\mcp\\call-2c8e8f65-7547-492c-a9be-66c04bfd6694-82.txt.]"}}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":119873,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-15752","agentTimestampMs":1785305825721,"promptId":"9bc4f375-71cd-4d1d-84e7-66516fb4f450","streamStartMs":1785305820238,"turnStartMs":1785305752224,"updateType":"ToolCallUpdate","updateParams":{"toolCallId":"call-2c8e8f65-7547-492c-a9be-66c04bfd6694-82","status":"Completed"}}}}
{"timestamp":1785305859,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I have a good understanding of this page. It's \"About the Guide\" - an introductory navigation document for TikTok API for Business documentation. I'll explain what this page is, whether it's the right..."}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":124954,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-15792","agentTimestampMs":1785305859496,"promptId":"9bc4f375-71cd-4d1d-84e7-66516fb4f450","streamStartMs":1785305856866,"turnStartMs":1785305752224,"updateType":"AgentThoughtChunk","chunkId":39}}}
{"timestamp":1785305868,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"# 这个链接是什么\n\n[About the Guide v1.3](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/about-the-guide/v1.3)  \n= **TikTok API for Business 文档导航页**（怎么读文档），不是具体接口说明。\n\n**门对了**（Business / 广告侧），但这页本身**不能用来申请、也不能直接拉数据**。\n\n---\n\n## 文档里有哪些产品\n\n| 产品 | 干什么 | 和你们关系 |\n|------|--------|------------|\n| **Marketing API** | 广告账户、计划、素材、**报表** | **要广告花费/ROI → 主要看这个** |\n| Organic API | 自然号、达人协作等 | 一般不先做 |\n| Business Messaging API | 私信 | 无关 |\n| API Reference / Get Started | 注册、建应用、调接口 | **申请和接入必走** |\n\n---\n\n## 你们该点哪几条（按顺序）\n\n1. **[Get Started](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713609895937)**  \n   注册开发者、建 App、拿 token、第一次调用  \n\n2. **[Marketing API](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1781891416235009)**  \n   广告能力总览（计划管理、报表等）  \n\n3. **[API Reference](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs?id=1735713875563521)**  \n   具体接口（报表 / campaign 等）  \n\n4. 需要时再看 **Use Cases** 里的 reporting 类用例  \n\n左侧 **Log in** 登录后才能完整用 Playground / 申请权限。\n\n---\n\n## 和「现网抓广告」对齐\n\n| 现网脚本字段 | 大致对应 |\n|--------------|----------|\n| campaign / 花费 / 订单 / ROI / 收入 | Marketing API **报表**（及 GMV Max 相关能力，看权限与文档） |\n\n注意：\n\n- 要有 **广告主账户**，并和店铺在 Business Center 绑好  \n- 权限常需审核，不是打开文档就能调  \n- 这和 **Shop Partner（订单/商品）** 仍是两套  \n\n---\n\n## 一句话\n\n| 问题 | 答案 |\n|------|------|\n| 这页对不对？ | **对**，是 Business API 总目录 |\n| 现在要做什么？ | 登录 → **Get Started** 建开发者应用 → 再进 **Marketing API + 报表接口** |\n| 停在 About the Guide？ | 不够，只是说明书目录 |\n\n下一步若你登录后看到「创建应用 / 申请权限」页面，可以截图发我，我帮你对该勾哪些能力。"}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":124954,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-16421","agentTimestampMs":1785305867454,"promptId":"9bc4f375-71cd-4d1d-84e7-66516fb4f450","streamStartMs":1785305856866,"turnStartMs":1785305752224,"updateType":"AgentMessageChunk","chunkId":668}}}
