{"timestamp":1785311404,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The user is asking what the database is for this project (清泉跨境系统). From my earlier exploration, I know they use PostgreSQL 16 as the Source of Truth."}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":108373,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-17627","agentTimestampMs":1785311404680,"promptId":"6ef9b7b9-50ce-43e0-b996-9d23a172bb51","streamStartMs":1785311375602,"turnStartMs":1785311367730,"updateType":"AgentThoughtChunk","chunkId":36}}}
{"timestamp":1785311407,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"# 清泉用的库\n\n**PostgreSQL 16**（项目里当 Source of Truth，主库）\n\n---\n\n## 本地 / Docker 常见配置\n\n| 项 | 默认值（见 `deploy/docker-compose.yml`） |\n|----|------------------------------------------|\n| 镜像 | `postgres:16-alpine` |\n| 库名 | `qingquan` |\n| 用户 | `qingquan` |\n| 密码 | `qingquan`（可被 `.env` 覆盖） |\n| 端口 | `5432` |\n| 连接串示例 | `postgresql+asyncpg://qingquan:qingquan@db:5432/qingquan` |\n\n---\n\n## 和飞书的关系\n\n- **主数据在 PG**  \n- 飞书多维表是同步/展示出口，不是主库  \n\n和 TK 相关的表里，广告日事实一般是：`fact_ads_campaign_daily`。"}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":108373,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-17833","agentTimestampMs":1785311407366,"promptId":"6ef9b7b9-50ce-43e0-b996-9d23a172bb51","streamStartMs":1785311375602,"turnStartMs":1785311367730,"updateType":"AgentMessageChunk","chunkId":242}}}
