.json and the other store debug files to POST ingest. Looking at structure from earlier - scrape-debug has payload.rows.\n"}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":215445,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-24457","agentTimestampMs":1785315986277,"promptId":"21be4f81-bd47-4175-a060-3dfb1cef9b7d","streamStartMs":1785315985048,"turnStartMs":1785314259986,"updateType":"AgentThoughtChunk","chunkId":36}}}
