{"timestamp":1785317693,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"Now write Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also re-scrape deal to deal if needed. For Deal to deal I need rows - I can open store and scrape with the fixed script then post.\nNow create a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug JSON and also from a live scrape of Deal to deal. Or simpler: post SHOP INOUT from debug-last, then for Deal - parse from the second run log... \n...Now write a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last and also from re-scrape of deal to deal. For deal to deal I'll use the multi-store debug if we re-scrape one store.\nNow create a Python script to POST from scrape-debug-last.json and also re-scrape Deal to deal if needed. For Deal to deal I'll use ziniao to scrape again and post immediately while API is verified.Good. Now write a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also re-scrape Deal to deal or use stored data. For Deal to deal I'll run a focused scrape via ziniao + page exec with the fix...Now write a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also try to scrape Deal to deal via ziniao if needed. For Deal to deal I'll open and scrape with the fixed script and post.Now create a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also try to scrape Deal to deal via ziniao and ingest both.Now write Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also scrape Deal to deal via ziniao if needed. For Deal to deal I can run ziniao open + page exec with fixed scrape script, then inges...Now write Python to ingest from scrape-debug-last and also need Deal to deal data. I'll re-scrape Deal to deal only with a quick PowerShell using existing multi-store patterns, save debug, then ingest...Now write a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also try to scrape deal to deal + shop inout via ziniao and post.Now write Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also open/scrape Deal to deal. Or re-scrape both stores with a short dedicated script.\nGood. Now create a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json and also re-scrape Deal to deal. For Deal - I can run ziniao store open + page exec with fixed scrape script, then POST.\nNow post from scrape-debug-last.json using Python httpx or urllibNow write a Python script to ingest from scrape-debug-last.json, then re-scrape Deal to deal and ingest that too."}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":216098,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-25983","agentTimestampMs":1785317678258,"promptId":"21be4f81-bd47-4175-a060-3dfb1cef9b7d","streamStartMs":1785317677157,"turnStartMs":1785314259986,"updateType":"AgentThoughtChunk","chunkId":28}}}
