{"timestamp":1785319269,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"Interesting - Deal to deal data IS in the DB even though we got 502! The previous failed attempt might have partially written, or a concurrent request succeeded. Looking at the output order - psql ran..."}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":238814,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-27414","agentTimestampMs":1785319265832,"promptId":"task-completed-call-e91e8f80-d8bf-42f7-ac98-7b8f64b96106-157","streamStartMs":1785319264408,"turnStartMs":1785317694312,"updateType":"AgentThoughtChunk","chunkId":41}}}
{"timestamp":1785319280,"method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"# 两步都做完了\n\n## 1. 数据库迁移 ✅\n- 用 `postgres` 账号执行了 `003_tiktok_ads_p1_fields.sql`\n- 新列：`plan_status` / `delivery_status` / `daily_budget` / `target_roi` / `net_cost` / `avg_order_cost`\n- 已把表权限交给 `qingquan`\n\n## 2. 抓取 + 进库 ✅（英区 2 店）\n\n| 店铺 | 业务日 | 系列数 | 花费 USD | 销售额 USD | 进 PG |\n|------|--------|--------|----------|------------|-------|\n| **SHOP INOUT** | 2026-07-28 | 10 | 777.31 | 7571.62 | ✅ |\n| **Deal to deal** | 2026-07-28 | 3 | 132.66 | 946.84 | ✅ |\n| Gardena（欧盟） | — | 0 | — | — | ❌ 紫鸟访问欧盟广告页失败（网络 `ERR_CONNECTION`） |\n\n样例字段（库内已有 P1）：\n- spend / orders / roi / revenue  \n- target_roi、net_cost、avg_order_cost  \n- plan_status（on/off）、delivery_status（已生效/已暂停）\n\n飞书：英区店 dual 写飞书成功；清泉在 **multi-store 长跑过程中 API 曾掉线**，已用「抓取结果补上报」把英区数据写入 PG。\n\n---\n\n## 过程中修的问题\n1. **表头误匹配**：短词 `roi` 误命中「目标 ROI」→ 已修（`scrape-ads-page.js` / `parse-table.js`）  \n2. **迁移权限**：表属主是 `postgres`，已用超户执行迁移  \n\n---\n\n## 说明\n- **原项目未改**；只动副本 + 清泉中心  \n- 清泉 API 当前可用（若要继续用：`backend\\.venv` + uvicorn `:8000`）  \n- multi-store 里 qingquan 偶发连不上，多半是本机 API 进程未常驻；生产建议用 Docker/服务方式挂着 API  \n\nGardena 修好欧盟店网络后，再跑一遍 multi-store 即可。需要的话我可以帮你写一条「API 常驻 + 定时 multi-store」的启动脚本。"}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":238814,"eventId":"019fab7f-7ed9-7553-a471-73b6cca96147-27969","agentTimestampMs":1785319278402,"promptId":"task-completed-call-e91e8f80-d8bf-42f7-ac98-7b8f64b96106-157","streamStartMs":1785319264408,"turnStartMs":1785317694312,"updateType":"AgentMessageChunk","chunkId":596}}}
